WEBVTT

00:01:35.760 --> 00:01:37.380
- Where's the pattern gone now?

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:39.840
- Oh, yeah!

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:40.980
- That goes like that.

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:41.760
- Come on, no way!

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:43.080
- That goes like this.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.460
- Oh, yeah, I got it, I got it, I got it, got it, got it!

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:22.440
We're going to be having a bazaar tomorrow.

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.520
Oh.

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:26.360
Our class is going to be in charge of giving tea, chocolate,

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:30.000
and cakes to everybody who comes to the bazaar, so everyone's

00:02:30.090 --> 00:02:38.740
wearing the same uniforms Tomoyo made up the pattern for this uniform

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:12.430
What are you making? Is that your uniform for tomorrow, Ariel?

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:13.860
That's right.

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:15.170
What did you say?

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:18.400
Nothing.

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.770
Just talking.

00:03:20.770 --> 00:03:23.400
How are you, Ariel?

00:03:23.400 --> 00:03:25.410
And hello!

00:03:25.410 --> 00:03:28.270
Spinny!

00:03:28.270 --> 00:03:30.000
Who are you calling Spinny?

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:35.450
Spinny! So much cuter, don't you think?

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.760
Did you know they're having a bazaar at school tomorrow?

00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:40.250
Yeah?

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:45.340
I'm going to be handing out tea and sweets, so if you come, you'll be able to have some.

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:48.770
Really? Count me in!

00:03:48.770 --> 00:03:51.330
Spinny, let's go together!

00:03:51.330 --> 00:03:52.850
No, thanks.

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:54.970
But why not?

00:03:54.970 --> 00:03:57.720
Well, because I can't eat sweet things.

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:58.640
*laughs*

00:04:00.280 --> 00:04:09.030
laughing about you're the one who made me unable to eat anything that sweet it's not that you can't

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:11.890
eat them it's just that things get weird when you do

00:05:07.520 --> 00:05:08.200
Thank you.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:31.910
What happened to Kiro?

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:36.530
Oh, he doesn't want to be seen, so he's gone behind the school.

00:05:36.530 --> 00:05:40.750
Oh, right! Is he behaving himself out there all alone?

00:05:42.260 --> 00:05:44.950
I hope so. He's got enough food.

00:06:07.390 --> 00:06:14.950
glad that so many people came to the bazaar this year. Me too. Let me tell you about bazaars. Bazaars were

00:06:14.950 --> 00:06:23.140
invented long ago at Niagara Falls. The water went over the edge, making a sound of zar-ba, zar-ba, zar-ba. And at some

00:06:23.140 --> 00:06:30.000
point in history, that got turned into the bazaar, bazaar, bazaar sound that we all know today. Here, take

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:34.660
table free right away please but the water splashed all over some of the

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.780
goods making a real mess

00:06:36.780 --> 00:06:42.460
yeah not bad and again I am used to it now

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:56.950
here's your tea and cake sir thank you you were in charge of decorating this

00:06:56.950 --> 00:07:00.000
classroom weren't you Sasaki yes

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.800
You did a fantastic job.

00:07:03.800 --> 00:07:06.560
It looks great.

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:23.150
Oh, well, thanks, Sakura.

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:25.640
And yours looks pretty good as well.

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:27.910
Thank you.

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.340
- What's up?

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:49.920
- Nothing.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:51.030
- Straight away.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:02.760
How are you?

00:08:02.760 --> 00:08:04.390
Yakito!

00:08:04.390 --> 00:08:06.860
Hey, thanks for inviting me down here.

00:08:06.860 --> 00:08:08.870
Pleasure.

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:10.400
So, where's the cake?

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.980
Huh?

00:08:12.980 --> 00:08:18.270
So you're here too?

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.520
Well, I'll try this one.

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:22.440
Okay.

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:31.800
Hmm. Very cute.

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.420
Huh?

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:34.820
What, the clothes?

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:39.820
Stop teasing her. I meant you, Sakura.

00:08:39.820 --> 00:08:43.680
Yuki, are you sure you don't need some new glasses?

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:45.680
Nope, my glasses are fine.

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:51.570
Huh? I'll get you some more food.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:11.630
What's the matter?

00:09:11.630 --> 00:09:16.500
Huh? Nothing. I just felt something.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:24.970
It looks like Sakura's brother can sense me.

00:09:24.970 --> 00:09:26.560
I'll have to be careful.

00:09:26.560 --> 00:09:29.120
Yeah, but not too careful, right?

00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:43.440
Not bad at all!

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:47.440
How I love you, how I love you! Oh no! Someone's coming!

00:09:47.440 --> 00:10:00.000
I can't wait to eat some chocolates, I can't wait to eat some cake, I can't wait to eat some chocolates and cookies, every single one tastes good to me!

00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:01.800
- Do you want any sweets, Spinny?

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:03.070
- Yes, I'm sure.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:08.520
- How come?

00:10:08.520 --> 00:10:11.350
I'm gonna try everything.

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:12.230
- Whatever.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:34.410
But I'm gonna eat it anyway

00:10:34.410 --> 00:10:36.510
Cause eating chocolate makes me feel

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:38.130
A warm and happy inside

00:10:38.130 --> 00:10:40.170
Oh yeah, it's the best

00:10:40.170 --> 00:10:59.120
I think I'll go have a nap now

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:00.000
Away from the

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:13.180
Now, where was I?

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:26.840
Hello, Kiro.

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:29.700
Oh, no.

00:11:40.360 --> 00:11:47.640
"This isn't good. If he finds out who I really am, it'll be hard for Ariel to do his thing."

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:14.570
- No way, I have a huge head.

00:12:14.570 --> 00:12:17.020
- Has he ever looked in the mirror?

00:12:17.020 --> 00:12:18.560
But if I argue with him,

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:21.140
he might be able to work out who I am.

00:12:21.140 --> 00:12:22.480
I better bite my tongue.

00:12:22.480 --> 00:12:27.670
- Oh, so your battery operated right.

00:12:27.670 --> 00:12:28.830
- Watch the paws.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:30.000
- Wow.

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:42.330
some freaky animals here in Japan and it speaks like a human as well huh huh

00:12:42.330 --> 00:12:49.820
huh now just hold on that distinctive shape those little wings that curly tail

00:12:49.820 --> 00:12:54.900
and that round face he knows you're a god

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:10.770
Now I know that nobody can sense our magical powers when we're in our borrowed forms, but

00:13:10.770 --> 00:13:12.800
even so I'm glad he didn't work it out.

00:13:12.800 --> 00:13:14.150
But a goblin?

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:16.330
Good detecting work there, Sherlock.

00:13:16.330 --> 00:13:23.170
This is way cuz I've never met a real goblin before!

00:13:23.170 --> 00:13:24.630
Hey there!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:25.630
My name's Kiro!

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:30.000
I'm a guardian beast made by a magician called Chloe Reed!

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:35.500
It's not just my borrowed form, but in my real form I look even more cool than I do right now!

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.750
*laughs*

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:44.240
Even though he can't sense my magic, I can't believe he hasn't figured out who I am.

00:13:44.240 --> 00:13:48.080
I'll just play along with him. He looks like a succulent.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:52.470
What's your name then?

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:53.680
Spit.

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:57.430
I guess there's no need to tell him my real name.

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:05.590
- That'll do.

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.790
- Spinny.

00:14:06.790 --> 00:14:08.420
- Spinny?

00:14:08.420 --> 00:14:11.060
Oh boy, that's a really dumb name.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:17.010
Ha ha, Spinny, ha ha!

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:18.280
- Would you like to be my friend,

00:14:18.280 --> 00:14:21.840
Spinny, Spinny, Spin, Spin?

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:24.920
- He's got the brains of a sock.

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.840
- What's the matter?

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:28.550
- Nothing.

00:14:30.120 --> 00:14:33.230
I don't want him to get suspicious.

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:36.820
I guess I'll have to tell Ariel later that I ran into Kiro.

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:39.720
Oh, this is great!

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.030
Huh?

00:14:41.030 --> 00:14:42.930
We can eat desserts together!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:45.950
Huh?

00:14:45.950 --> 00:14:48.030
Huh?

00:14:48.030 --> 00:14:49.030
Don't be shy!

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.530
There's plenty of sweets!

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:52.830
Well, actually, I don't eat sweets.

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:56.520
Of course you do!

00:14:56.520 --> 00:15:00.000
Now let's see what's next.

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:05.890
Still working on that one?

00:15:06.090 --> 00:15:07.050
There's tons more.

00:15:07.190 --> 00:15:08.670
Just relax and dig in.

00:15:08.890 --> 00:15:09.790
This one's good.

00:15:09.950 --> 00:15:10.850
This one, too.

00:15:11.170 --> 00:15:23.430
And this one, and sweetest.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:30.000
Don't you feel okay?

00:15:30.350 --> 00:15:31.900
- What's wrong with you?

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:33.120
- I want more.

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.160
I want more.

00:15:35.290 --> 00:15:38.580
- Huh?

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:39.860
- I want more.

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:43.760
- Give me more!

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:08.090
Hey, get off me.

00:16:08.090 --> 00:16:11.030
I'm being friendly, silly boy.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.900
Can I get you some more?

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:15.340
Yes, please.

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:17.550
Ooh, me too.

00:16:17.550 --> 00:16:22.750
Sure. Oh, nice.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:28.870
Huh? Spinner?

00:17:09.820 --> 00:17:27.840
The cookie that I left here, have you?

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:45.400
Gotta eat more of that sweet stuff.

00:18:04.350 --> 00:18:06.990
- You want some?

00:18:06.990 --> 00:18:09.990
- Don't mind if I--

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:15.090
Hey, put that down and listen to me.

00:18:15.090 --> 00:18:17.750
If Sakura finds out that all the sweets have gone,

00:18:17.750 --> 00:18:19.530
she's gonna be furious.

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:30.000
Gotta hurry, before someone comes.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:31.810
- Hello, how are you today?

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:34.060
- Uh-oh.

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:39.480
Hey, Spinny!

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:41.840
You don't want to eat with me?

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:43.160
Huh?

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.310
-

00:19:03.680 --> 00:19:04.180
Huh?

00:19:04.180 --> 00:19:06.360
Where did that breeze come from?

00:19:06.360 --> 00:19:27.000
You weren't me, Poobie!

00:19:27.000 --> 00:19:28.840
This up, people are bound to notice.

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:10.090
sleep car you've got to put everyone to sleep with the sleep card look don't ask

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:16.040
why just do it okay then

00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.290
That's just about enough of this!

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:53.720
Since call Reed, it's no use. He just got away.

00:21:53.720 --> 00:21:57.290
What was me?

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:06.240
And you ate all the things we gave to the teachers!

00:22:06.240 --> 00:22:08.560
No, it wasn't me! It was Spiddy!

00:22:08.560 --> 00:22:13.860
I'll draw you a picture if you want.

00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:18.950
He's got wings like this, and his eyes are like this.

00:22:18.950 --> 00:22:20.680
And his head is big like this.

00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:23.800
Uh...

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:27.520
Oh yeah, that's him. There's your thief.

00:22:27.520 --> 00:22:29.730
Looks like...

00:23:00.160 --> 00:23:02.620
Spinny certainly ate a lot of sweets today.

00:23:05.280 --> 00:23:08.650
He really goes crazy over those candies and cakes.

00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:13.280
He and Kiro could be a perfect match.

00:23:13.860 --> 00:23:15.680
Yes, they could.

00:24:33.000 --> 00:24:36.680
Lucky me! I went to a teddy bear exhibit with all of my friends.

00:24:36.680 --> 00:24:38.760
There's so many cute bears!

00:24:38.760 --> 00:24:44.630
I'm really glad I came, but on the way home, I ended up getting stuck with Lee in the elevator!

00:24:44.630 --> 00:24:49.770
Hey! We got a text on Cardcaptor Sakura!

00:24:49.770 --> 00:24:53.270
Sakura, Shaoran, and the elevator!
